Package: pulsaros-circle-to-search
Version: 1.0.10
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, libgtk4-layer-shell0, tesseract-ocr, wl-clipboard, xdg-utils
Suggests: sayri, grim, gnome-screenshot
Description: Circle to Search feature with AI and Google integration for Pulsar OS.
 High-tech interactive screen selection tool triggered by mouse shaking or global shortcut.
 Features real-time OCR extraction with Tesseract, a floating Sayri AI query box with
 dynamic glassmorphic design, and instant visual Google Search.
